    {
      "index": 4,
      "className": "csp-story",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A beautiful boutique B&B in Cork with exceptional reviews, almost no organic search visibility and a growing bill for OTA commissions."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The B&B had a thin website with no SEO, no Google Business Profile work and near-zero visibility for any relevant search. Fifteen to twenty percent of every booking went to OTAs for guests who typed the B&B's own town into Google."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Technical audit and rebuild of the site around hospitality searches: town, attractions, room types",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Google Business Profile optimisation and a review request routine for departing guests",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Content for 'B&B Cork', 'accommodation Cork' and the attractions guests visit",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Local links from Cork tourism directories and regional press",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A peak-season Google Ads campaign to catch demand the organic work had not reached yet",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Within nine months organic traffic was up 180%, the property ranked on page one for twelve target searches and direct bookings had doubled, cutting OTA dependency."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "text": "“Khalid's team transformed our online presence. We're getting direct bookings we never had before and the phone is ringing from people who found us on Google.”\n\nOwner, B&B owner, Cork"
        }
      ]
    },
